WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.510
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.510 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 22]

01:50.380 --> 01:51.220
Firecrackers

01:51.380 --> 01:53.060
should herald the Chinese New Year.

01:54.540 --> 01:56.060
Yet, while the summer heat lingers,

01:56.980 --> 01:58.420
the air is already thick with the festive spirit.

01:58.980 --> 02:00.300
The blasting has lasted from the Mao hour to the Shen hour.

02:01.500 --> 02:02.460
Everyone's saying

02:02.580 --> 02:03.700
the frontier troops nearly tore apart

02:03.700 --> 02:04.500
the Northern Desert King's tent.

02:05.180 --> 02:05.660
Mr. Xie,

02:06.500 --> 02:07.740
do you still intend to go to the frontier?

02:08.340 --> 02:09.300
The Northern Desert King

02:09.300 --> 02:10.780
is already at the end of his rope.

02:12.420 --> 02:13.900
Why should I get entangled

02:14.940 --> 02:15.780
in this mess?

02:18.300 --> 02:19.260
I'll just send some nobody

02:20.020 --> 02:21.020
to go through the motions.

02:21.740 --> 02:23.260
This was supposed to be our setup.

02:24.220 --> 02:25.060
Had it not been for Xie Yanlai,

02:25.060 --> 02:26.060
Zhong Changrong would be dead.

02:26.740 --> 02:28.220
Once your men in Wangcheng

02:28.220 --> 02:28.980
killed the Northern Desert King

02:29.260 --> 02:30.780
and Liang Qiang moved in to reclaim Wangcheng,

02:31.180 --> 02:32.180
the frontier troops would be ours

02:32.180 --> 02:32.940
for the taking.

02:34.660 --> 02:36.340
That brat's meddling

02:36.620 --> 02:37.420
ruined the entire plan.

02:38.860 --> 02:39.540
What's the rush?

02:41.260 --> 02:42.540
The merit roll still lists

02:42.700 --> 02:44.140
a Xie at the top.

02:45.860 --> 02:47.380
Does it really matter

02:48.180 --> 02:48.780
who leads the troops?

02:50.620 --> 02:52.260
Besides, it's not even certain

02:53.900 --> 02:54.980
he'll live to collect his reward.

02:55.820 --> 02:56.620
Mr. Xie, you mean...?

03:00.620 --> 03:02.060
The moonlight is stunning.

03:03.100 --> 03:04.700
Let's put the celebration banquet aside.

03:06.100 --> 03:07.260
I must first give Mr. Deng

03:08.580 --> 03:09.420
a proper send-off.

03:19.460 --> 03:20.060
Something's on fire.

03:21.900 --> 03:22.660
Not quite.

03:23.220 --> 03:24.460
I've been around enough forest fires

03:24.900 --> 03:25.820
to smell one

03:25.820 --> 03:26.500
before it starts.

03:46.580 --> 03:48.020
The fire spread fast and fierce.

03:49.220 --> 03:50.260
They've drenched the room

03:50.580 --> 03:51.860
in fire oil.

03:52.460 --> 03:53.500
Had I been a moment later,

03:54.260 --> 03:55.180
I would not have made it out.

03:57.540 --> 03:58.100
Deng Yi died

04:00.860 --> 04:01.900
just like that?

04:03.860 --> 04:05.420
I don't usually get along with Mr. Deng.

04:06.260 --> 04:07.300
But I refuse to believe

04:08.060 --> 04:09.860
he would collude with our enemies.

04:10.420 --> 04:11.220
For the moment,

04:12.020 --> 04:12.620
our priority

04:12.620 --> 04:14.260
is to stabilize the court.

04:15.260 --> 04:16.300
Mr. Deng has been confined.

04:17.020 --> 04:17.820
At this moment,

04:19.060 --> 04:20.100
I should step up.

04:21.380 --> 04:22.780
"To stabilize the court"?

04:25.100 --> 04:26.420
"Step up"? How noble.

04:27.260 --> 04:27.900
Xie Yanfang

04:27.900 --> 04:29.100
truly is a master of strategy.

04:29.980 --> 04:30.940
Everything is flawlessly calculated.

04:31.580 --> 04:32.740
The Imperial Guard Office

04:33.140 --> 04:34.540
is still investigating the fire,

04:35.380 --> 04:35.980
and the body

04:36.300 --> 04:37.580
has been sent to the coroner.

04:44.260 --> 04:44.820
Your Highness.

04:46.180 --> 04:46.900
Your Highness!

04:48.140 --> 04:52.740
[Xie Residence]

05:05.460 --> 05:06.260
Your Highness,

05:06.660 --> 05:07.740
I suppose you heard about Mr. Deng...

05:07.740 --> 05:08.820
Did you order his death?

05:10.820 --> 05:12.220
Your Highness, what is this about?

05:12.820 --> 05:13.420
Who else

05:14.140 --> 05:15.060
would dare?

05:18.860 --> 05:20.420
Your Highness, you are mistaken.

05:21.780 --> 05:22.540
There is another

05:24.740 --> 05:26.620
who has the nerve,

05:27.980 --> 05:28.860
the will,

05:30.260 --> 05:32.260
and far more reason besides.

05:37.660 --> 05:39.060
And that person is you,

05:40.500 --> 05:41.980
the Grand Princess.

05:42.860 --> 05:44.660
You and Mr. Deng have long been at odds.

05:45.340 --> 05:45.780
The Grand Mentor's Residence

05:45.780 --> 05:47.180
is filled with the Imperial Guards.

05:47.540 --> 05:49.260
How could suspicion

05:49.900 --> 05:52.820
for his murder ever fall on me?

05:53.380 --> 05:54.700
If I were to kill him,

05:55.460 --> 05:56.740
it would be according to the law,

05:57.060 --> 05:57.940
with clear evidence,

05:57.980 --> 05:59.380
and for all to see.

06:00.620 --> 06:01.660
Is Your Highness suggesting

06:04.620 --> 06:07.060
I am underhanded

06:09.420 --> 06:10.660
and can only operate

06:10.660 --> 06:12.100
in the shadows?

06:13.140 --> 06:14.740
Even if I killed him,

06:16.660 --> 06:18.180
would you really kill me

06:19.860 --> 06:21.100
for revenge?

06:22.460 --> 06:23.740
Are you using this opportunity

06:24.900 --> 06:26.660
to get rid of me as well?

06:36.900 --> 06:38.540
I never thought

06:39.740 --> 06:40.860
that you would be the one to save me.

06:42.420 --> 06:43.500
Mr. Deng, did you really think

06:44.220 --> 06:45.300
a lock could keep me

06:45.940 --> 06:47.220
in that side residence?

06:48.660 --> 06:50.060
I was merely waiting

06:50.060 --> 06:51.100
for the perfect moment

06:51.780 --> 06:53.020
to leave the Capital.

06:55.140 --> 06:56.540
I never imagined that beneath the city

06:57.380 --> 06:58.780
lay such a secret.

06:59.540 --> 07:00.740
In your eyes,

07:02.020 --> 07:02.780
the Capital

07:03.820 --> 07:05.980
is just a board for power struggles.

07:08.140 --> 07:10.300
Father, however, viewed it

07:10.340 --> 07:12.460
as a home to return to.

07:13.500 --> 07:14.540
Over the years,

07:15.900 --> 07:18.220
he remembered everything,

07:20.100 --> 07:22.340
from the halls of noble mansions

07:22.420 --> 07:24.300
to the very number of bluestone slabs

07:24.340 --> 07:25.820
on these streets.

07:28.180 --> 07:28.940
Indeed.

07:30.380 --> 07:31.620
No threshold in the imperial city,

07:32.380 --> 07:33.860
however high, can keep out

07:35.060 --> 07:35.820
those who yearn for home.

07:37.260 --> 07:38.220
I suppose

07:39.180 --> 07:40.020
I am nothing more

07:40.020 --> 07:41.780
than His Lordship's gatekeeper,

07:42.620 --> 07:44.980
entrusted with his most precious holding of all,

07:45.980 --> 07:46.700
this Capital.

07:47.540 --> 07:48.300
It's all fated.

07:49.740 --> 07:50.380
It was written

07:51.500 --> 07:53.860
that I would save you tonight.

07:57.980 --> 07:58.460
Mr. Deng,

07:58.700 --> 07:59.860
your meal is ready.

08:04.980 --> 08:06.220
They have come for you.

08:07.260 --> 08:08.500
Were it not for me,

08:10.100 --> 08:11.500
this is

08:11.940 --> 08:13.540
where your life ends.

08:15.380 --> 08:15.900
Tie Ying,

08:16.500 --> 08:16.940
set the fire.

08:17.500 --> 08:17.900
Let's go.

08:24.580 --> 08:25.980
With this water,

08:27.540 --> 08:28.340
let's toast

08:30.100 --> 08:31.300
to our escape

08:33.420 --> 08:34.460
from the jaws of death.

08:45.380 --> 08:46.020
Was it

08:47.260 --> 08:49.180
Her Highness who wanted to kill you?

08:49.940 --> 08:50.580
It was not her.

08:52.860 --> 08:53.940
It was Xie Yanfang.

08:56.500 --> 08:58.180
To think he could be so vicious.

09:00.340 --> 09:01.300
I favor poison.

09:02.620 --> 09:03.820
Yet he proved even more venomous.

09:07.900 --> 09:10.020
Thank you for saving my life, Your Highness.

09:10.660 --> 09:11.620
What is it you desire, Your Highness?

09:13.900 --> 09:14.820
Speak plainly.

09:16.340 --> 09:17.340
I've bided my time in the depths long enough.

09:19.700 --> 09:20.620
Mr. Deng,

09:20.620 --> 09:21.940
since you're always cautious,

09:23.100 --> 09:24.100
I assume everything that matters

09:24.900 --> 09:26.300
is close at hand.

09:30.020 --> 09:30.820
Please, Mr. Deng,

09:31.420 --> 09:32.420
escort me home.

09:40.300 --> 09:41.500
Can we actually get away?

09:45.900 --> 09:46.900
I have arranged

09:47.940 --> 09:48.940
for someone to die in your place.

09:52.300 --> 09:53.500
That should buy us some time.

10:06.140 --> 10:06.620
Your Highness,

10:07.060 --> 10:08.180
Zhu Yong just reported

10:08.500 --> 10:09.540
that the corpse was not Mr. Deng.

10:10.500 --> 10:10.980
What?

10:12.340 --> 10:12.940
Are you certain?

10:13.220 --> 10:14.260
The coroner has finished the examination.

10:14.420 --> 10:15.100
It is confirmed.

11:20.260 --> 11:21.300
The dew feels chilly.

11:35.980 --> 11:37.300
Your Highness is too precious to fall ill.

11:40.100 --> 11:41.180
Please take care.

12:02.580 --> 12:04.340
It has come to this after all.

12:05.020 --> 12:06.780
With Xie Yanlai's great merit,

12:07.860 --> 12:09.420
the frontier troops under the Xie Family,

12:10.300 --> 12:11.700
and no footing whatsoever

12:12.540 --> 12:13.980
left for you

12:13.980 --> 12:14.780
in Xiao Yu's court,

12:15.500 --> 12:17.260
why suffer under Chu Zhao and Xie Yanfang

12:18.460 --> 12:19.740
when you could come with me to Xiaonan Prefecture?

12:21.300 --> 12:22.260
If I ascend to the throne,

12:23.620 --> 12:25.580
you will still be the Grand Mentor of the State of Chu.

12:56.700 --> 12:57.940
He is indeed not Deng Yi.

12:59.140 --> 13:00.540
Good thing we retrieved the body in time.

13:01.100 --> 13:02.340
If the face had been burned beyond recognition,

13:02.860 --> 13:04.060
it would be impossible to identify.

13:04.500 --> 13:06.020
I fear that should something happen to Mr. Deng,

13:06.340 --> 13:07.140
regardless of whether he lives,

13:07.180 --> 13:08.220
it will be detrimental to Your Highness.

13:08.740 --> 13:09.820
Someone will frame you

13:09.940 --> 13:10.780
for wanting him eliminated.

13:11.580 --> 13:12.500
What does this have to do with Her Highness?

13:12.780 --> 13:13.900
All the officials saw

13:14.380 --> 13:15.540
the Imperial Guard Office

13:15.740 --> 13:17.780
escort him to the imperial city

13:17.900 --> 13:18.740
and lock him in his residence.

13:19.220 --> 13:20.700
Now that the frontier troops have captured the Northern Desert King,

13:21.140 --> 13:22.260
Your Highness's influence is surging.

13:22.860 --> 13:23.940
Eliminating him now

13:24.220 --> 13:25.540
would not stir unrest.

13:26.020 --> 13:27.140
The timing could not be better.

13:27.740 --> 13:28.700
That is nonsense.

13:29.300 --> 13:30.140
Her Highness

13:30.140 --> 13:31.100
has no reason to kill Mr. Deng.

13:31.260 --> 13:32.260
Disagreement in policy

13:32.500 --> 13:33.340
and struggle for power

13:33.780 --> 13:34.980
are reason enough.

13:37.140 --> 13:38.780
If Xiaoman had not been fast enough

13:39.340 --> 13:40.140
to charge into the fire

13:40.260 --> 13:41.100
and drag him out,

13:41.740 --> 13:42.740
we would truly believe

13:43.420 --> 13:44.220
he was

13:44.380 --> 13:45.420
dead.

13:46.740 --> 13:47.780
The first problem

13:47.780 --> 13:48.580
we must resolve

13:49.100 --> 13:49.900
is those issues

13:49.940 --> 13:50.980
you're worried about, Mr. Zhu.

13:51.340 --> 13:52.420
So this body

13:52.580 --> 13:53.620
is a stand-in?

13:54.540 --> 13:55.620
Did he arrange this himself,

13:55.660 --> 13:56.620
or was it someone else's doing?

13:57.260 --> 13:58.460
And what was the purpose?

13:59.860 --> 14:00.860
To fake his death and escape?

14:01.660 --> 14:02.180
Xiao Xun.

14:03.780 --> 14:04.220
Zhu Yong,

14:04.620 --> 14:05.740
go to Xiao Xun's residence immediately

14:05.780 --> 14:06.380
and report back what you find.

14:06.700 --> 14:07.140
Yes.

14:20.740 --> 14:21.540
The entire Grand Mentor's Residence

14:21.540 --> 14:22.580
has been searched,

14:22.900 --> 14:23.860
but there is no trace of Deng Yi.

14:24.460 --> 14:25.380
We kept watch outside,

14:25.460 --> 14:26.700
and not a soul was seen coming or going.

14:27.340 --> 14:27.860
But

14:28.180 --> 14:29.260
there must be something

14:29.260 --> 14:30.180
we missed.

14:30.940 --> 14:31.740
He couldn't just vanish

14:31.740 --> 14:32.540
into thin air.

14:33.940 --> 14:34.580
They knew

14:34.580 --> 14:35.820
you were posted outside.

14:36.180 --> 14:37.020
They wouldn't have moved

14:37.580 --> 14:38.900
without a way out.

14:41.540 --> 14:41.980
By the way,

14:42.500 --> 14:43.580
is Mr. Deng's mother still here?

14:44.260 --> 14:45.380
Everyone in the Grand Mentor's Residence

14:45.420 --> 14:46.540
is under guard.

14:47.020 --> 14:47.820
Mr. Deng's mother

14:47.820 --> 14:49.060
has been placed under separate care.

14:59.380 --> 15:00.860
We searched where Mr. Deng

15:01.820 --> 15:02.620
conducts his affairs too.

15:03.940 --> 15:05.020
The Imperial Seal alone is missing.

15:08.860 --> 15:09.980
That was my oversight.

15:11.460 --> 15:12.300
It is not your fault, Your Highness.

15:13.540 --> 15:14.700
Mr. Deng was under confinement

15:15.300 --> 15:16.140
and yet to be convicted.

15:17.740 --> 15:19.340
No one has the authority to seize

15:19.820 --> 15:21.220
the Imperial Seal gifted by the late Emperor.

15:21.940 --> 15:23.460
Mr. Deng's power and influence

15:24.180 --> 15:24.860
stemmed from the position

15:24.860 --> 15:25.940
granted by the late Emperor

15:26.020 --> 15:27.420
and his possession of the Imperial Seal.

15:28.060 --> 15:29.260
Whether he faked his death

15:29.300 --> 15:30.260
or was taken away,

15:30.540 --> 15:31.820
he would surely take it with him.

15:35.340 --> 15:35.900
Your Highness,

15:36.700 --> 15:37.740
Xiao Xun is gone indeed.

15:39.780 --> 15:40.500
Relay my order.

15:40.700 --> 15:41.860
Lock down all city gates immediately.

15:43.220 --> 15:43.860
Your Highness,

15:44.060 --> 15:44.780
there is a secret passage in the room.

15:59.260 --> 16:00.140
Deng Yi

16:00.140 --> 16:01.260
and Xiao Xun

16:02.700 --> 16:04.300
have finally joined forces.

16:05.140 --> 16:06.220
Once they return

16:06.220 --> 16:07.460
to Xiaonan Prefecture,

16:08.540 --> 16:10.060
they will seize the chance to rebel.

16:16.220 --> 16:17.780
Is the course of fate

16:19.020 --> 16:20.140
truly beyond my reach,

16:22.180 --> 16:23.860
no matter how hard I struggle?

16:33.700 --> 16:34.140
Mr. Xie,

16:37.820 --> 16:38.780
we used poison,

16:38.780 --> 16:40.020
so why did a fire break out?

16:41.140 --> 16:42.100
A minor mishap

16:42.100 --> 16:42.900
from an unexpected twist,

16:44.260 --> 16:45.500
but of no consequence.

16:46.540 --> 16:47.020
Du Qi,

16:47.740 --> 16:48.660
get things ready.

16:48.820 --> 16:49.660
I need to make a long journey.

16:50.500 --> 16:50.940
Where to?

16:52.060 --> 16:53.620
North of the Cang River, to intercept

16:54.140 --> 16:55.460
the Lord of Xiaonan's rebel forces.

16:59.020 --> 17:00.500
Since when did they rebel?

17:03.180 --> 17:04.220
Our grand mentor

17:05.260 --> 17:06.160
is soon to become

17:06.180 --> 17:07.060
theirs.

17:09.780 --> 17:10.820
Only then

17:11.980 --> 17:12.900
will he and Her Highness

17:13.180 --> 17:14.100
be truly locked

17:14.100 --> 17:15.460
in a fight to the death.

17:17.580 --> 17:18.940
This is more intriguing

17:21.460 --> 17:22.580
than my original plan.

17:27.460 --> 17:31.260
- Wish Your Lordship a long life. - Wish Your Lordship a long life.

17:42.660 --> 17:43.140
Your Lordship,

17:43.580 --> 17:44.700
His Majesty's gift has arrived.

17:45.660 --> 17:47.940
I'm glad he thinks of me.

17:47.940 --> 17:48.660
That is enough.

17:49.900 --> 17:51.420
Nothing warms my heart more

17:51.580 --> 17:53.620
than the people of Xiaonan celebrating in the streets

17:53.940 --> 17:55.100
of their own accord.

17:55.940 --> 17:56.340
Indeed.

17:57.260 --> 17:58.660
Distribute these among the people,

17:59.020 --> 18:00.820
so they may share in the joy.

18:01.380 --> 18:01.820
Your Lordship,

18:02.020 --> 18:02.740
you seem to have forgotten

18:03.260 --> 18:04.140
His Highness's gift

18:04.140 --> 18:05.460
arrived

18:05.540 --> 18:06.420
alongside His Majesty's.

18:07.260 --> 18:07.860
Yes.

18:08.380 --> 18:09.020
Bring it forward.

18:09.620 --> 18:10.380
Let me see

18:10.500 --> 18:12.420
what surprise he has for me.

18:23.420 --> 18:24.340
Each character is written

18:24.340 --> 18:26.060
by His Highness himself.

18:26.300 --> 18:26.740
Your Lordship,

18:27.020 --> 18:28.020
this is the Scroll of Longevity

18:28.020 --> 18:29.060
from His Highness.

18:29.420 --> 18:31.540
Such devotion

18:31.580 --> 18:32.980
is truly quite impressive!

18:35.380 --> 18:35.820
Come.

18:36.020 --> 18:37.060
Everyone, take a look.

18:44.300 --> 18:45.660
Xun must have put in a lot of effort.

18:45.940 --> 18:47.060
Writing in such small script

18:47.620 --> 18:49.100
must have strained his eyes.

18:49.220 --> 18:49.780
Indeed.

18:50.740 --> 18:52.660
Each character is written in a different style.

18:53.220 --> 18:54.580
Xun is truly thoughtful.

18:57.820 --> 18:59.780
The scent of the ink is quite unique as well.

18:59.820 --> 19:01.260
His Highness has arrived!

19:02.220 --> 19:02.780
Father!

19:03.260 --> 19:03.780
Father!

19:04.100 --> 19:04.660
Xun,

19:04.940 --> 19:06.500
are you the true surprise?

19:06.500 --> 19:06.980
Father,

19:07.500 --> 19:07.940
quick.

19:08.220 --> 19:09.100
Throw it away! It is poisoned!

19:09.420 --> 19:09.900
Father.

19:12.060 --> 19:12.980
Your Highness, what are you...?

19:16.140 --> 19:16.700
Father.

19:18.620 --> 19:19.100
Father.

19:19.540 --> 19:19.980
Your Lordship.

19:21.820 --> 19:22.300
Your Lordship!

19:22.660 --> 19:24.020
- Father. - Your Lordship.

19:24.500 --> 19:25.460
- Your Lordship. - Your Lordship.

19:26.060 --> 19:27.460
Father.

19:29.700 --> 19:30.140
Father.

19:30.700 --> 19:31.300
Father!

19:38.620 --> 19:39.220
Your Lordship!

19:39.260 --> 19:39.780
Father!

19:41.260 --> 19:41.900
Father!

19:43.860 --> 19:44.460
Your Highness,

19:45.020 --> 19:46.460
what is going on?

19:46.700 --> 19:48.180
Why has His Lordship been poisoned?

19:54.700 --> 19:55.500
The poison lies within the script.

19:57.100 --> 19:58.420
Once inhaled, it pierces the vitals.

20:01.820 --> 20:02.380
Father.

20:04.460 --> 20:05.180
Sir, quick.

20:05.340 --> 20:05.980
Check on His Lordship.

20:11.540 --> 20:12.220
But Your Highness,

20:12.620 --> 20:14.420
you prepared this yourself.

20:14.700 --> 20:16.100
How could it be poisoned?

20:16.700 --> 20:17.540
When the palace said

20:18.580 --> 20:19.580
they would present the gifts to Father

20:19.580 --> 20:20.660
on my behalf,

20:21.820 --> 20:22.820
I gave it little thought.

20:23.500 --> 20:24.940
Once I finished the Scroll of Longevity,

20:25.820 --> 20:27.260
I handed it over to the palace.

20:28.060 --> 20:28.940
But several days ago,

20:29.620 --> 20:30.780
someone told me

20:32.980 --> 20:34.020
that my gift

20:34.860 --> 20:36.220
might cost my father his life.

20:37.020 --> 20:38.420
He said the scroll

20:39.700 --> 20:40.660
had been soaked in poison.

20:42.220 --> 20:43.700
I knew Father would pay no mind

20:43.700 --> 20:44.820
to gifts from the court,

20:45.540 --> 20:46.500
yet would examine

20:46.500 --> 20:48.220
anything from me with great care.

20:49.020 --> 20:50.020
Close enough to inspect it,

20:50.940 --> 20:52.020
he would inhale the poison from the ink,

20:52.700 --> 20:53.100
and...

20:54.020 --> 20:54.340
He

20:54.700 --> 20:55.860
helped me flee the Capital.

20:56.220 --> 20:57.740
I traveled day and night

20:57.780 --> 20:59.140
to stop Father,

20:59.780 --> 21:00.580
but

21:00.980 --> 21:03.020
I was still a step too late.

21:03.540 --> 21:04.860
- Father! - Your Highness.

21:04.900 --> 21:05.340
Your Highness,

21:05.460 --> 21:06.620
you must remain calm.

21:07.580 --> 21:09.460
Is there any way to save His Lordship?

21:16.900 --> 21:17.380
Mr. Deng,

21:17.900 --> 21:19.020
please, save my Father!

21:19.820 --> 21:20.260
Deng Yi?

21:20.660 --> 21:21.460
Why are you here?

21:22.220 --> 21:23.300
Guards, seize him.

21:23.340 --> 21:24.060
You have it all wrong.

21:25.180 --> 21:26.540
It was Mr. Deng who helped me return.

21:27.780 --> 21:28.220
Your Highness,

21:28.540 --> 21:29.460
the person you mentioned earlier

21:29.700 --> 21:30.260
was him?

21:35.340 --> 21:35.940
Mr. Deng.

21:37.940 --> 21:38.340
Your Highness.

21:38.380 --> 21:38.740
Your Highness.

21:38.940 --> 21:39.540
Please

21:39.780 --> 21:40.900
save my father.

21:41.500 --> 21:42.420
I beg of you.

21:43.340 --> 21:43.700
Well...

21:45.100 --> 21:45.540
Mr. Deng,

21:46.100 --> 21:46.780
please,

21:46.820 --> 21:47.780
save His Lordship.

21:48.060 --> 21:48.540
Mr. Deng,

21:48.780 --> 21:49.380
save His Lordship.

21:49.420 --> 21:50.020
Please.

21:50.380 --> 21:51.220
I implore you, Mr. Deng.

21:54.940 --> 21:55.700
Your Highness, please rise.

21:58.820 --> 22:00.220
I do as you wish,

22:01.140 --> 22:02.620
but you must keep your promise.

22:12.820 --> 22:13.380
Mr. Deng.

22:14.620 --> 22:15.820
The poison runs too deep.

22:17.340 --> 22:18.020
He is beyond saving.

22:19.580 --> 22:20.140
Father!

22:20.700 --> 22:21.540
Your Highness.

22:22.380 --> 22:22.820
Father.

22:23.820 --> 22:25.460
Since you told His Highness

22:25.460 --> 22:26.220
about the poison

22:26.580 --> 22:28.100
and helped him escape,

22:28.380 --> 22:29.740
you must know something.

22:30.140 --> 22:30.660
Indeed.

22:30.700 --> 22:31.780
His Lordship has sent His Highness

22:31.780 --> 22:33.060
to the Capital as a hostage,

22:33.380 --> 22:34.540
so who would want

22:34.660 --> 22:35.740
to harm His Lordship?

22:36.380 --> 22:36.860
Mr. Deng,

22:37.140 --> 22:38.540
who exactly is behind this?

22:41.060 --> 22:41.980
The late Emperor.

22:42.860 --> 22:43.420
What?

22:43.500 --> 22:44.020
The late Emperor?

22:44.180 --> 22:45.220
How is that possible?

22:45.500 --> 22:46.740
Mr. Deng, you must be mistaken.

22:47.100 --> 22:48.660
If the late Emperor wanted His Lordship dead,

22:48.980 --> 22:50.300
why wait until now?

22:51.220 --> 22:52.220
I mean

22:53.300 --> 22:54.660
it was the late Emperor who sowed

22:55.340 --> 22:57.300
the seeds of His Lordship's end.

22:58.540 --> 22:59.500
Do you know

22:59.940 --> 23:01.580
who the late Emperor designated

23:02.420 --> 23:03.700
as the Crown Prince

23:03.900 --> 23:05.340
on his deathbed

23:05.620 --> 23:07.140
when the Capital was in peril?

23:07.860 --> 23:08.860
His grandson, wasn't it?

23:09.620 --> 23:10.100
- Yes. - No.

23:12.140 --> 23:13.540
It was the heir to the Lord of Xiaonan,

23:14.860 --> 23:15.740
Xiao Xun.

23:15.740 --> 23:16.100
What?

23:17.300 --> 23:17.780
Is this true?

23:17.900 --> 23:19.100
How can we trust you?

23:25.500 --> 23:27.180
Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan,

23:27.700 --> 23:28.740
is virtuous, wise,

23:29.220 --> 23:30.940
beneficent to the people

23:31.420 --> 23:33.180
and judicious in governance.

23:34.020 --> 23:35.300
He shall ascend the imperial throne

23:35.940 --> 23:37.700
and bear the weight of the state.

23:39.580 --> 23:40.860
On his deathbed,

23:41.460 --> 23:43.220
the late Emperor named Xiao Xun

23:43.700 --> 23:45.100
as his heir.

23:47.860 --> 23:49.060
The late Emperor

23:49.500 --> 23:51.380
did issue this decree on his deathbed.

23:52.020 --> 23:53.540
I am the witness.

23:55.100 --> 23:57.220
However, Chu Zhao and the Xie Family conspired

23:57.620 --> 23:59.140
to hold the late Emperor hostage

23:59.140 --> 24:00.540
and forced him to issue a new decree.

24:01.900 --> 24:02.860
This imperial edict

24:04.140 --> 24:05.820
never even made it

24:05.820 --> 24:07.100
past the palace gates.

24:56.100 --> 24:56.740
Father,

24:59.060 --> 25:00.180
are you unable to sleep,

25:01.660 --> 25:03.060
or is sleep simply beyond your reach?

25:07.740 --> 25:08.300
Do not fear.

25:10.180 --> 25:10.900
Soon, you will be able

25:10.900 --> 25:12.180
to rest soundly,

25:13.580 --> 25:14.580
never to wake again.

25:19.500 --> 25:20.860
You always loved

25:21.500 --> 25:22.660
to stroke my face like this,

25:24.740 --> 25:26.300
and I always loved

25:26.660 --> 25:28.060
lingering close beside you.

25:29.820 --> 25:30.940
Among all your children,

25:32.260 --> 25:33.220
only

25:34.260 --> 25:35.260
I was blessed

25:35.260 --> 25:36.380
with such affection.

25:37.580 --> 25:38.740
To repay

25:38.900 --> 25:39.740
your indulgence,

25:40.380 --> 25:40.980
now that I've sat

25:42.540 --> 25:43.900
on the throne,

25:45.460 --> 25:47.060
I shall honor you as the late Emperor.

25:48.140 --> 25:49.860
At last, your wish is fulfilled.

25:52.740 --> 25:53.340
Father.

25:55.300 --> 25:56.100
Are you happy?

26:00.340 --> 26:01.260
I am truly happy.

26:03.940 --> 26:05.340
Although I used to say

26:06.060 --> 26:08.100
I wanted to help you fulfill your wishes,

26:08.740 --> 26:09.940
I never knew

26:09.940 --> 26:11.220
if I would feel happy

26:12.900 --> 26:14.220
once they were accomplished.

26:15.540 --> 26:16.860
But now I understand.

26:18.340 --> 26:19.660
So this is what it feels like

26:20.540 --> 26:21.580
to be happy for oneself.

26:31.140 --> 26:32.500
It's finally done.

26:33.500 --> 26:35.420
I should go visit Mr. Deng.

26:36.580 --> 26:37.100
Tie Ying,

26:37.940 --> 26:38.940
bring the Golden Finch Venom

26:39.340 --> 26:40.020
and soak the scroll.

26:52.180 --> 26:53.620
Mr. Deng,

26:54.940 --> 26:55.820
what brings you here?

26:56.940 --> 26:57.860
The decree has reached

26:58.340 --> 27:00.460
Xiaonan Prefecture and the eight commanderies

27:01.020 --> 27:02.220
and twelve cities beyond.

27:02.500 --> 27:04.700
Outside the prefecture, thirty thousand regional troops

27:04.820 --> 27:05.980
have lifted their defenses

27:06.340 --> 27:07.460
and stand ready to be commanded.

27:08.060 --> 27:08.900
I appreciate it, Mr. Deng.

27:10.980 --> 27:14.100
The Prince of State's Residence is stronger than ever

27:14.860 --> 27:16.940
with you on our side.

27:18.020 --> 27:18.860
Your Highness is too kind.

27:19.860 --> 27:21.420
It is His Lordship's foresight we should credit.

27:22.220 --> 27:24.140
All those decades of winning loyalty,

27:24.940 --> 27:25.500
and one command

27:26.180 --> 27:27.620
is all it would take.

27:31.220 --> 27:32.340
Yet no command ever came.

27:33.260 --> 27:34.100
Father held it back

27:34.780 --> 27:36.580
for decades.

27:37.740 --> 27:38.940
Without you,

27:39.900 --> 27:40.700
today would have been

27:41.340 --> 27:42.140
no different.

27:43.460 --> 27:44.700
It seems

27:45.980 --> 27:46.780
His Lordship

27:47.580 --> 27:49.100
owes Your Highness thanks.

27:50.020 --> 27:51.580
You willingly threw away

27:52.060 --> 27:53.900
His Lordship's life

27:54.980 --> 27:56.420
for control over the state.

28:00.380 --> 28:01.900
It was my father's wish.

28:04.460 --> 28:06.100
To see it fulfilled,

28:06.780 --> 28:07.660
he cast me aside without hesitation.

28:08.660 --> 28:10.580
Much less would he spare himself.

28:12.060 --> 28:13.060
His death

28:14.380 --> 28:15.220
would be for a worthy cause.

28:16.500 --> 28:17.420
We have secured

28:18.260 --> 28:19.780
the garrison in Xiaonan

28:19.780 --> 28:20.700
and the surrounding local forces.

28:21.660 --> 28:22.900
But progress toward the Capital

28:22.940 --> 28:23.940
is far less smooth.

28:24.580 --> 28:26.060
The Grand Princess has reached out

28:26.300 --> 28:27.020
to all post houses

28:27.020 --> 28:28.460
and prefectures along the route,

28:28.940 --> 28:30.180
and now, most of our decrees

28:30.180 --> 28:31.180
have been intercepted.

28:36.140 --> 28:36.980
Who would have thought

28:38.140 --> 28:39.300
the Grand Princess's decrees

28:40.060 --> 28:41.380
would carry more weight than those

28:41.460 --> 28:42.260
of the Emperor?

28:44.900 --> 28:45.460
Your Majesty,

28:45.900 --> 28:47.220
everything is prepared.

28:47.820 --> 28:49.180
Please proceed to the enthronement ceremony

28:49.260 --> 28:50.620
along with Mr. Deng.

29:10.300 --> 29:12.020
The late Emperor's final decree is here.

29:13.100 --> 29:14.660
In the autumn of the fifteenth year of Tianshu,

29:15.100 --> 29:16.300
I am approaching my end.

29:17.060 --> 29:18.660
Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan,

29:18.980 --> 29:20.180
is virtuous, wise,

29:20.620 --> 29:22.260
beneficent to the people

29:22.540 --> 29:24.180
and judicious in governance.

29:24.580 --> 29:25.700
He shall ascend the imperial throne

29:26.140 --> 29:27.540
and bear the weight of the state.

29:28.140 --> 29:29.220
Proclaim this to the world

29:30.060 --> 29:31.740
so that all may know.

29:32.660 --> 29:33.780
Kneel.

29:35.820 --> 29:37.140
Kowtow.

29:39.220 --> 29:40.420
Rise.

29:42.260 --> 29:43.620
Kowtow.

29:47.500 --> 29:48.580
You may rise.

29:51.660 --> 29:52.900
Read the proclamation.

29:54.340 --> 29:55.580
On the twenty-seventh day of the eighth month,

29:56.020 --> 29:57.180
in the third year of Xingping,

29:57.660 --> 29:58.740
the Prince of State passed away.

29:59.420 --> 30:01.220
Deng Yi, the Grand Mentor, withdrew to Xiaonan Prefecture,

30:01.700 --> 30:03.100
carrying the late Emperor's final decree.

30:03.700 --> 30:06.020
[The Capital]
No righteous men in court, but traitors within.

30:06.300 --> 30:07.440
During the turmoil of the Yongning year,

30:07.780 --> 30:09.640
the imperial in-law Xie Yanfang

30:09.940 --> 30:12.620
colluded with the frontier troops, took the late Emperor hostage,

30:13.300 --> 30:13.940
usurped the throne

30:14.420 --> 30:15.220
bent the state to his will,

30:15.580 --> 30:16.940
and poisoned the Prince of State.

30:18.020 --> 30:19.060
In the ninth month

30:19.100 --> 30:19.740
of the third year of Xingping,

30:20.420 --> 30:22.020
Xiao Xun, heir to the Prince of State,

30:22.260 --> 30:23.700
acting on the late Emperor's decree,

30:24.060 --> 30:25.380
enthrones Chu Zhao as Empress,

30:25.980 --> 30:27.660
raises arms against the treacherous Xie Yanfang

30:27.940 --> 30:29.060
to restore order

30:29.540 --> 30:30.820
and sets forth on campaign.

30:37.700 --> 30:38.260
Move out.

30:45.780 --> 30:47.300
Deng Yi forged the imperial decree,

30:48.020 --> 30:50.540
claiming the late Emperor intended to pass the throne to Xiao Xun.

30:51.500 --> 30:52.980
He holds the Imperial Seal,

30:53.580 --> 30:54.820
so he can write

30:54.820 --> 30:55.300
whatever he pleases.

30:56.180 --> 30:57.500
The late Emperor was poisoned that night.

30:58.260 --> 30:59.340
Who knows

30:59.540 --> 31:00.300
what the truth really was?

31:02.180 --> 31:03.060
At this point,

31:03.500 --> 31:04.500
what is false becomes true.

31:05.740 --> 31:06.500
Ministers,

31:06.500 --> 31:07.700
do not be disturbed by rumors.

31:08.540 --> 31:10.540
Mr. Xie has blocked the rebel army at the Cang River,

31:11.180 --> 31:12.340
and the Northern Desert King has surrendered.

31:12.780 --> 31:14.460
The frontier will soon be stable.

31:14.980 --> 31:16.660
We have enough energy

31:16.700 --> 31:18.380
and troops to quell the rebellion.

31:19.580 --> 31:21.380
Xiao Xun is merely walking the same doomed path.

31:22.100 --> 31:23.900
Even with Deng Yi, what could a pathetic wretch

31:25.020 --> 31:27.580
like him possibly amount to?

31:28.460 --> 31:30.460
His Majesty will issue the proclamation

31:30.820 --> 31:32.020
and make it known to all.

31:33.580 --> 31:34.220
Court dismissed.

31:35.020 --> 31:37.620
- We bid farewell to Your Majesty - We bid farewell to Your Majesty

31:37.980 --> 31:39.980
- and Your Highness. - and Your Highness.

31:51.260 --> 31:52.780
You were so quick to grasp

31:53.020 --> 31:54.020
"besieging Wei to rescue Zhao."

31:54.700 --> 31:55.860
Why are you struggling so much

31:55.940 --> 31:56.660
with "concealing the dagger behind a smile"?

31:57.020 --> 31:57.860
Zhao,

31:58.020 --> 31:59.180
it's just

31:59.260 --> 32:00.220
so hard.

32:01.020 --> 32:02.700
Can I learn that some other time?

32:06.100 --> 32:06.860
Greetings, Your Majesty,

32:07.460 --> 32:08.300
Your Highness.

32:10.420 --> 32:11.380
Uncle, you're back.

32:16.060 --> 32:17.140
Mr. Xie, you must be exhausted.

32:17.940 --> 32:18.700
I thought

32:18.700 --> 32:19.700
you still had an hour to go.

32:20.180 --> 32:21.660
Fortunately, the meal is prepared.

32:21.820 --> 32:22.780
Please, take a seat and eat.

32:23.700 --> 32:24.140
I appreciate it.

32:24.740 --> 32:25.340
Uncle,

32:25.780 --> 32:26.620
try some and see

32:26.940 --> 32:27.700
if it agrees with you.

32:36.980 --> 32:38.300
There's a new chef in the palace

32:38.300 --> 32:39.820
who specializes in Gaoyang flavors.

32:40.260 --> 32:41.300
Yu finds it quite good.

32:41.740 --> 32:42.580
It tastes very much

32:42.580 --> 32:43.700
like what his mother used to enjoy.

32:46.220 --> 32:47.420
It feels so good to be home.

32:52.220 --> 32:52.940
To see one's kin

32:53.460 --> 32:54.260
is to be home.

33:02.060 --> 33:02.980
The chef brewed this himself

33:03.340 --> 33:04.940
with a traditional method.

33:05.260 --> 33:05.900
Yanfang,

33:06.260 --> 33:07.020
please, have a sip.

33:23.100 --> 33:23.500
Thank you.

33:24.020 --> 33:24.540
Uncle,

33:24.780 --> 33:25.660
try some of this.

33:26.100 --> 33:27.580
This is my favorite.

33:27.820 --> 33:28.140
Very well.

33:33.020 --> 33:33.580
Here, Yu.

33:37.780 --> 33:38.900
I have a chef

33:39.100 --> 33:40.300
who makes exceptional rice cakes.

33:41.020 --> 33:41.820
I shall bring some

33:42.340 --> 33:43.700
for Your Highness to try another day.

33:44.780 --> 33:45.380
Uncle,

33:45.500 --> 33:46.340
can I try some as well?

33:47.580 --> 33:48.380
Of course.

33:54.300 --> 33:54.700
Here.

33:55.460 --> 33:57.060
Uncle, try this.

34:03.340 --> 34:04.180
North of the Cang River,

34:04.460 --> 34:05.540
three commanderies and twenty-eight cities

34:06.580 --> 34:07.900
have all submitted to Xiao Xun.

34:08.700 --> 34:09.700
Together with the Lord of Xiaonan's

34:09.700 --> 34:10.780
illegally raised forces,

34:12.300 --> 34:13.460
the total comes to two hundred and seventy thousand.

34:14.380 --> 34:15.500
I never expected

34:15.500 --> 34:16.860
they could gather

34:17.220 --> 34:18.740
so many troops in just a few months.

34:19.500 --> 34:20.860
Rebellions always begin

34:21.580 --> 34:22.780
with a roar

34:22.940 --> 34:23.980
of momentum.

34:24.620 --> 34:25.340
Deng Yi

34:25.580 --> 34:27.500
stole the Tally and the Imperial Seal.

34:28.300 --> 34:29.220
It is no surprise that many people

34:29.540 --> 34:30.540
have been misled.

34:32.660 --> 34:33.740
In time,

34:34.300 --> 34:35.980
when the court sends forces against them,

34:37.220 --> 34:38.220
people will see the truth.

34:40.940 --> 34:42.060
Just like in the previous life,

34:42.820 --> 34:43.860
Xiao Xun ascends to the throne,

34:44.780 --> 34:46.380
and the one who leads the campaign against him is Xie Yanfang.

34:54.060 --> 34:54.740
Do not worry.

34:56.060 --> 34:56.780
I am here.

34:59.420 --> 35:00.180
I am not worried.

35:01.300 --> 35:01.940
Once Jiu

35:02.660 --> 35:04.180
escorted the Northern Desert King across the frontier,

35:04.860 --> 35:05.980
he could lead the troops

35:05.980 --> 35:07.100
to provide support

35:07.580 --> 35:08.380
and form a pincer movement

35:08.380 --> 35:09.460
with the court's forces.

35:09.900 --> 35:11.460
The Lord of Xiaonan's rebels

35:11.740 --> 35:12.460
will be crushed.

35:15.820 --> 35:16.620
Do you miss him?

35:20.620 --> 35:21.220
What?

35:54.100 --> 35:54.900
The time has come.

35:55.900 --> 35:56.420
Let's go.

35:57.500 --> 35:59.100
Chu Ling must have wished

35:59.740 --> 36:01.580
to storm my tent

36:02.580 --> 36:04.020
just as you did.

36:04.860 --> 36:06.220
It is precisely because General Chu

36:06.220 --> 36:07.540
kept you locked in battle for decades

36:08.700 --> 36:09.940
that I now have the chance

36:10.060 --> 36:11.100
to take you down.

36:11.860 --> 36:12.900
You are very valorous.

36:14.700 --> 36:15.820
Your father

36:16.940 --> 36:18.380
must have been proud of you.

36:25.660 --> 36:27.420
My son is much stronger than you.

36:28.820 --> 36:32.180
He knew his father loved him until the very end.

36:40.500 --> 36:41.620
I have one last question for you.

36:44.140 --> 36:45.140
What really happened

36:45.860 --> 36:47.860
with that fire in the Wei Village

36:48.580 --> 36:50.180
five years ago?

36:55.700 --> 36:57.180
Back then, Chu Yan had Alan Ruoying

36:57.440 --> 37:00.620
survive as the leader of a band of bandits,

37:00.680 --> 37:01.600
Mu Mianhong,

37:02.040 --> 37:04.000
and hide in the Cangmu Forest.

37:04.900 --> 37:06.120
So, we decided

37:06.120 --> 37:07.900
to make a deal with the Lord of Xiaonan.

37:08.120 --> 37:09.880
We set a fire at the Wei Village

37:09.880 --> 37:11.720
at the foot of the Cangmu Forest

37:12.120 --> 37:13.240
and left clues

37:13.240 --> 37:15.000
to frame the Cangmu Stronghold.

37:15.360 --> 37:16.940
Once the court of the State of Chu

37:16.940 --> 37:18.320
followed our lead

37:18.320 --> 37:19.760
to investigate the stronghold,

37:20.680 --> 37:22.480
they would discover

37:22.480 --> 37:23.840
Mu Mianhong's true identity,

37:24.600 --> 37:25.550
which would serve

37:25.560 --> 37:27.480
as ironclad proof of Chu Ling's treason.

37:28.160 --> 37:30.600
If Yunzhong Prefecture lost Chu Ling,

37:31.120 --> 37:33.720
seizing the frontier would be a simple task.

37:34.520 --> 37:36.120
I do not know

37:36.360 --> 37:38.560
why the clues pointing to the Cangmu Stronghold were erased,

37:39.000 --> 37:40.960
and why you appeared

37:40.960 --> 37:42.360
in that fire

37:42.800 --> 37:44.150
and ended up

37:44.160 --> 37:46.440
taking the blame for us.

37:46.940 --> 37:47.980
Later,

37:49.900 --> 37:52.420
I heard that the young man from the Xie Family

37:52.420 --> 37:54.700
framed for burning the village had gone to the frontier

37:55.400 --> 37:56.940
and become the most capable vanguard

37:56.940 --> 37:58.220
by Chu Ling's side.

37:59.180 --> 38:01.260
As they say in the Central Plains,

38:01.860 --> 38:03.500
the world never unfolds as planned.

38:04.700 --> 38:05.820
I never imagined

38:06.980 --> 38:08.280
we would meet again

38:08.280 --> 38:09.960
on the battlefield like this.

38:11.300 --> 38:12.260
Now

38:13.260 --> 38:14.420
you have settled

38:14.420 --> 38:15.820
the debt of that injustice.

38:19.460 --> 38:20.740
General, we are under attack.

38:20.860 --> 38:21.740
We have been surrounded.

38:24.380 --> 38:25.180
Is it someone looking for you?

38:26.420 --> 38:27.660
Who wants you dead?

38:29.380 --> 38:30.860
It could be anyone.

38:31.220 --> 38:32.820
To claim the throne,

38:32.940 --> 38:34.620
one must first remove the predecessor.

38:36.100 --> 38:37.220
I want to see

38:38.820 --> 38:40.500
who can actually take my life.

38:40.500 --> 38:41.900
You can butcher each other for all I care,

38:42.740 --> 38:43.300
but

38:44.300 --> 38:46.020
you must not die within the State of Chu.

38:46.540 --> 38:47.100
Follow me.

38:47.980 --> 38:48.420
Hurry.

38:57.260 --> 38:57.700
Go!

39:31.500 --> 39:31.940
Mr. Xie,

39:33.540 --> 39:34.440
I heard that Her Highness

39:34.440 --> 39:35.300
is personally leading another campaign.

39:35.940 --> 39:37.100
Has she developed a taste for war,

39:38.100 --> 39:38.860
or

39:39.500 --> 39:41.020
is she acting out of spite because Xiao Xun declared

39:41.660 --> 39:42.460
he would take her as his Empress?

39:43.260 --> 39:44.300
Regardless of the reason,

39:45.740 --> 39:46.940
if she wants to do it, she should go.

39:47.700 --> 39:49.100
We need only pave the road for her,

39:50.420 --> 39:51.660
just like the dead-end road

39:52.540 --> 39:53.940
we paved for Yanlai.

39:55.900 --> 39:56.980
I received a secret report.

40:00.240 --> 40:01.440
Yanlai is dead.

40:02.220 --> 40:03.700
He died believing

40:04.560 --> 40:06.120
that the ones who attacked him and the Northern Desert King

40:07.060 --> 40:08.260
were Xiao Xun's men.

40:08.780 --> 40:09.980
You are truly far-sighted.

40:13.260 --> 40:14.580
Deng Yi dying at her hands

40:15.820 --> 40:17.420
is better than him dying at mine.

40:18.260 --> 40:19.500
They started with an alliance

40:19.900 --> 40:21.140
and ended up shattered by infighting.

40:22.620 --> 40:24.540
Once she learns of Yanlai's death,

40:26.220 --> 40:27.400
there will be no reconciliation

40:27.420 --> 40:28.380
between her and Xiao Xun.

40:32.300 --> 40:32.780
Well,

40:34.660 --> 40:35.380
are the night refreshments ready?

40:36.580 --> 40:37.260
Yes.

40:37.540 --> 40:38.660
Have them packed

40:39.620 --> 40:40.700
and delivered to Her Highness.

40:41.300 --> 40:42.860
You are far too good to her, Mr. Xie,

40:43.500 --> 40:44.340
yet gratitude

40:44.340 --> 40:45.260
is not in her nature.

40:46.020 --> 40:47.220
I don't know what you are aiming for.

40:53.420 --> 40:54.820
The better I treat her now,

40:56.300 --> 40:57.060
the greater

40:57.060 --> 40:58.660
her agony will be.

41:00.580 --> 41:01.660
Once she kills Xiao Xun

41:02.820 --> 41:04.580
and returns covered in wounds,

41:06.340 --> 41:08.140
I must ensure she has a place to return to.

41:15.620 --> 41:16.780
That scoundrel Xiao Xun

41:17.140 --> 41:18.020
actually dared to declare

41:18.020 --> 41:18.940
that he would take Your Highness as his empress.

41:21.340 --> 41:22.920
All he wants is for me to become

41:22.920 --> 41:23.700
what he is,

41:24.580 --> 41:26.060
a rebel who seized the throne

41:26.780 --> 41:28.060
and deserves to be struck down

41:28.060 --> 41:28.820
by all.

41:28.860 --> 41:29.260
Your Highness,

41:29.620 --> 41:30.660
you should march out with the troops now

41:30.980 --> 41:31.980
and claim his head

41:32.260 --> 41:33.220
before the eyes of the world.

41:50.380 --> 41:51.060
Your Highness,

41:51.700 --> 41:52.860
are you feeling unwell?

41:53.580 --> 41:54.340
I don't know what is wrong.

41:55.980 --> 41:56.940
I feel terribly anxious.

42:10.540 --> 42:11.660
My chances of winning are higher

42:12.620 --> 42:13.700
in this battle against Xiao Xun.

42:14.260 --> 42:15.260
Even if it is difficult to defy fate,

42:15.620 --> 42:17.220
at worst, we will fight to the death.

42:18.780 --> 42:19.820
Yet why

42:20.780 --> 42:21.820
does my heart feel so unsettled?

42:24.740 --> 42:25.180
Your Highness,

42:25.620 --> 42:26.300
urgent report from the frontier.

42:26.900 --> 42:27.540
What has happened at the frontier?

42:28.700 --> 42:29.540
It is General Fu Jiu.

42:31.660 --> 42:32.300
What about Jiu?

42:33.020 --> 42:33.980
General Fu Jiu and the Northern Desert King

42:34.620 --> 42:35.620
were ambushed by an unknown army.

42:36.220 --> 42:37.020
Whether they survived is unclear.

43:00.300 --> 43:00.980
Are you going to the frontier?

43:01.780 --> 43:02.140
Yes.

43:02.940 --> 43:03.700
Must you go?

43:04.780 --> 43:05.580
Yes.

43:06.380 --> 43:07.500
He is dead.

43:17.980 --> 43:18.820
No body means

43:20.100 --> 43:21.620
there is still a chance.

43:22.820 --> 43:23.860
I believe General Zhong

43:25.020 --> 43:26.100
has been looking for him.

43:29.460 --> 43:30.500
If you are worried,

43:33.300 --> 43:34.500
I will send more men.

43:36.180 --> 43:37.060
If he is alive,

43:38.380 --> 43:39.460
I will retrieve him myself.

43:40.780 --> 43:41.380
If he is gone,

43:43.220 --> 43:45.060
I will do everything in my power to uncover the truth.

43:47.180 --> 43:48.340
You are the Grand Princess.

43:49.460 --> 43:51.100
Xiao Xun has risen in revolt,

43:52.180 --> 43:52.660
and

43:52.660 --> 43:53.500
you would leave the court

43:53.500 --> 43:54.340
over something so absurd?

43:55.500 --> 43:56.700
If something happens,

43:58.060 --> 43:59.580
you will regret it forever.

44:00.460 --> 44:01.860
Do you think I am doing this

44:01.860 --> 44:03.020
only for one Xie Yanlai?

44:04.420 --> 44:05.540
As the Grand Princess,

44:06.820 --> 44:08.220
if I remain indifferent to the unjust death

44:09.980 --> 44:11.300
of a loyal general,

44:13.140 --> 44:14.580
who else will be willing to give their life for the state?

44:39.460 --> 44:40.100
Xie Yanfang,

44:41.660 --> 44:42.580
you dare try to kill me?

44:43.300 --> 44:44.580
By leaving the court without sanction, Your Highness

44:44.580 --> 44:45.500
is putting the very foundation of the state at risk.

44:46.060 --> 44:47.020
Since I am aware of this,

44:47.020 --> 44:48.060
I cannot ignore it.

44:49.340 --> 44:50.420
If you come back with me,

44:51.100 --> 44:52.900
I will pretend nothing happened.

45:31.740 --> 45:36.340
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

45:36.620 --> 45:39.100
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

45:39.140 --> 45:43.180
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

45:45.420 --> 45:47.540
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

45:47.620 --> 45:49.580
♪And roars in the blaze♪

45:49.660 --> 45:52.900
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

45:53.060 --> 45:55.300
♪Fate imprisons me♪

45:55.460 --> 46:00.260
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

46:00.260 --> 46:04.460
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

46:04.460 --> 46:08.740
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

46:08.740 --> 46:14.180
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

46:14.180 --> 46:16.140
♪With no fear of the distance♪

46:16.140 --> 46:19.860
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

46:19.860 --> 46:24.300
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

46:24.300 --> 46:29.660
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

46:29.660 --> 46:33.260
♪My new pride♪

46:48.060 --> 46:50.940
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

46:50.940 --> 46:53.460
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

46:53.460 --> 46:55.820
♪Amidst the chaos♪

46:55.820 --> 47:00.100
♪I'll always be with you♪

47:01.540 --> 47:03.660
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

47:03.740 --> 47:05.700
♪And roars in the blaze♪

47:05.780 --> 47:09.020
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

47:09.180 --> 47:11.420
♪Fate imprisons me♪

47:11.580 --> 47:16.380
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

47:16.380 --> 47:20.580
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

47:20.580 --> 47:24.860
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

47:24.860 --> 47:30.300
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

47:30.300 --> 47:32.260
♪With no fear of the distance♪

47:32.260 --> 47:35.980
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

47:35.980 --> 47:40.420
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

47:40.420 --> 47:45.780
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

47:45.780 --> 47:49.380
♪My new pride♪
